# DUSKLING R6, MUSHROOM HOLLOW (room 34): mushroom caps over a drop: only a slam springs off them (a warp pocket).
# Played from its way in with plain button presses (LEFT is the D-pad
# side, A the button side), found once by the route finder.
game duskling
wait 5
cheat room 34
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 10
hold LEFT+A 7
hold A 21
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 4
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 4
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 14
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 26
hold LEFT+A 16
hold A 21
wait 2
expect room == 8
